<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115662" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψηφο-θέτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>maker of tessellated pavements, Gloss.;</i> written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψηφοδ[έ]τας</span></b>  in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				532
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Perinthus</span>):—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψηφο-θετέω</span></b> , <i>make such
				work</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>JRS</u>
				18.171
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Gerasa</span>), <u>Gloss.</u>; and
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψηφο-θέτημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <i>the
				work itself,</i> ib.</div>
